== 1. no machine file ==
  layer off: provenance lines 0
   autonomy: default → plan_gate=auto · builder_questions=default-safe · evolve_apply=auto-reversible (explicit > autonomy > default · opt out: autonomy: standard)
  path with no file: provenance lines 0
  doctor unchanged
== 2. a machine file ==
  provenance lines 1
   autonomy: default → plan_gate=auto · builder_questions=default-safe · evolve_apply=auto-reversible (explicit > autonomy > default · opt out: autonomy: standard)
   machine preferences: <FIX>/prefs — bash ops/polaris prefs shows which keys it sets here
  every other line unchanged
== 3. POLARIS_PREFS unset: the default path ==
   machine preferences: <FIX>/home/.claude/polaris/preferences — bash ops/polaris prefs shows which keys it sets here
   machine preferences: <FIX>/cfgdir/polaris/preferences — bash ops/polaris prefs shows which keys it sets here
